msgid "You are now signed out on all other browsers and devices."
msgstr "Wylogowano cię ze wszystkich innych przeglądarek i urządzeń."

msgid "Download your data first."
msgstr "Najpierw pobierz swoje dane."

msgid "Sign in again to confirm this request."
msgstr "Zaloguj się ponownie, aby potwierdzić to żądanie."

#, python-format
msgid "We sent a confirmation code to %(email)s."
msgstr "Wysłaliśmy kod potwierdzający na adres %(email)s."

msgid "Enter the 6-digit code."
msgstr "Wpisz 6-cyfrowy kod."

msgid "That code has expired. Request a new one."
msgstr "Ten kod wygasł. Poproś o nowy."

msgid "Too many attempts. Request a new code."
msgstr "Zbyt wiele prób. Poproś o nowy kod."

msgid "Incorrect code."
msgstr "Nieprawidłowy kod."

msgid "Your account and all your data have been removed."
msgstr "Twoje konto i wszystkie dane zostały usunięte."

msgid "Enter your email to sign in."
msgstr "Wpisz swój adres e-mail, aby się zalogować."

#, python-format
msgid "We sent a verification code to %(email)s."
msgstr "Wysłaliśmy kod weryfikacyjny na adres %(email)s."

msgid "Enter your email to get a verification code."
msgstr "Wpisz swój adres e-mail, aby otrzymać kod weryfikacyjny."

msgid "Email verified — you're signed in."
msgstr "Adres e-mail zweryfikowany – logowanie udane."

#, python-format
msgid "We sent a new code to %(email)s."
msgstr "Wysłaliśmy nowy kod na adres %(email)s."

msgid "Signed out."
msgstr "Wylogowano."

#. NOTE: date,weight[,note] names the columns of a CSV line; translate the
#. names (note is optional).
#, python-format
msgid "line %(line)d: expected date,weight[,note]"
msgstr "wiersz %(line)d: oczekiwano data,waga[,notatka]"

#, python-format
msgid "line %(line)d: invalid date %(value)s"
msgstr "wiersz %(line)d: nieprawidłowa data %(value)s"

#, python-format
msgid "line %(line)d: invalid weight %(value)s"
msgstr "wiersz %(line)d: nieprawidłowa waga %(value)s"

#, python-format
msgid "line %(line)d: weight out of range"
msgstr "wiersz %(line)d: waga poza zakresem"

#. NOTE: The email subject; the code is at the end, with no full stop, so it
#. can be copied.
#, python-format
msgid "Your verification code is %(code)s"
msgstr "Twój kod weryfikacyjny to %(code)s"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your verification code is %(code)s.\n"
"\n"
"It expires in %(num)d minute. If you didn't request this, ignore this email."
msgid_plural ""
"Your verification code is %(code)s.\n"
"\n"
"It expires in %(num)d minutes. If you didn't request this, ignore this email."
msgstr[0] ""
"Twój kod weryfikacyjny to %(code)s.\n"
"\n"
"Wygasa za %(num)d minutę. Jeśli to nie ty, zignoruj tę wiadomość."
msgstr[1] ""
"Twój kod weryfikacyjny to %(code)s.\n"
"\n"
"Wygasa za %(num)d minuty. Jeśli to nie ty, zignoruj tę wiadomość."
msgstr[2] ""
"Twój kod weryfikacyjny to %(code)s.\n"
"\n"
"Wygasa za %(num)d minut. Jeśli to nie ty, zignoruj tę wiadomość."

msgid "Confirm removal of your data"
msgstr "Potwierdź usunięcie swoich danych"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your confirmation code is %(code)s.\n"
"\n"
"Entering it will permanently delete your account and all your weight data. "
"It expires in %(num)d minute. If you didn't request this, ignore this email "
"and your data stays untouched."
msgid_plural ""
"Your confirmation code is %(code)s.\n"
"\n"
"Entering it will permanently delete your account and all your weight data. "
"It expires in %(num)d minutes. If you didn't request this, ignore this email"
" and your data stays untouched."
msgstr[0] ""
"Twój kod potwierdzający to %(code)s.\n"
"\n"
"Po jego wpisaniu twoje konto i wszystkie dane o wadze zostaną trwale "
"usunięte. Kod wygasa za %(num)d minutę. Jeśli to nie ty, zignoruj tę "
"wiadomość – twoje dane pozostaną nietknięte."
msgstr[1] ""
"Twój kod potwierdzający to %(code)s.\n"
"\n"
"Po jego wpisaniu twoje konto i wszystkie dane o wadze zostaną trwale "
"usunięte. Kod wygasa za %(num)d minuty. Jeśli to nie ty, zignoruj tę "
"wiadomość – twoje dane pozostaną nietknięte."
msgstr[2] ""
"Twój kod potwierdzający to %(code)s.\n"
"\n"
"Po jego wpisaniu twoje konto i wszystkie dane o wadze zostaną trwale "
"usunięte. Kod wygasa za %(num)d minut. Jeśli to nie ty, zignoruj tę "
"wiadomość – twoje dane pozostaną nietknięte."

msgid "That email domain doesn't accept mail (no MX record)."
msgstr "Ta domena e-mail nie przyjmuje poczty (brak rekordu MX)."

msgid "Couldn't check that email domain right now. Try again."
msgstr "Nie udało się teraz sprawdzić tej domeny e-mail. Spróbuj ponownie."

msgid "Your session has expired. Reload the page and try again."
msgstr "Twoja sesja wygasła. Odśwież stronę i spróbuj ponownie."

msgid "Your session has expired and nothing was changed. Please try again."
msgstr "Twoja sesja wygasła i nic nie zostało zmienione. Spróbuj ponownie."

msgid "That page isn't available, so you were taken to the start page."
msgstr "Ta strona jest niedostępna, więc przeniesiono cię na stronę główną."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The file is too large: the limit is %(size)s. Nothing was imported or "
"changed."
msgstr ""
"Plik jest za duży: limit to %(size)s. Nic nie zostało zaimportowane ani "
"zmienione."

msgid "Something went wrong on our side. Please try again in a moment."
msgstr "Coś poszło nie tak po naszej stronie. Spróbuj ponownie za chwilę."

msgid "Email"
msgstr "Adres e-mail"

msgid "Verification code"
msgstr "Kod weryfikacyjny"

msgid "Enter the height as a plain number, e.g. 180 or 1.8."
msgstr "Wpisz wzrost jako zwykłą liczbę, np. 180 lub 1,8."

#. NOTE: Label of the body height field in the settings.
msgid "Height"
msgstr "Wzrost"

msgid "Unit"
msgstr "Jednostka"

msgid "Dark mode"
msgstr "Tryb ciemny"

msgid "Moving average (days)"
msgstr "Średnia krocząca (dni)"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Height must be between %(min_cm)s and %(max_cm)s cm (%(min_m)s and %(max_m)s"
" m)."
msgstr ""
"Wzrost musi mieścić się w zakresie od %(min_cm)s do %(max_cm)s cm (od "
"%(min_m)s do %(max_m)s m)."

#. NOTE: Switch in the settings that makes the weight chart visible on a public
#. web page.
msgid "Share my chart on a public page"
msgstr "Udostępnij mój wykres na publicznej stronie"

#. NOTE: Switch in the settings: show the kilograms on the public chart, or
#. only the shape of the line.
msgid "Show my weight"
msgstr "Pokaż moją wagę"

#. NOTE: Switch in the settings: show the boxes with the current average, BMI
#. and changes under the public chart.
msgid "Show the stat boxes on the public page"
msgstr "Pokaż pola statystyk na publicznej stronie"

#. NOTE: Label of the field with the last part of the public page's address
#. (the "ramon" in .../public/ramon).
msgid "Page ID"
msgstr "ID strony"

#, python-format
msgid "Use %(min)d to %(max)d letters (a-z), digits, hyphens or underscores."
msgstr "Użyj od %(min)d do %(max)d liter (a-z), cyfr, łączników lub podkreśleń."

msgid "That ID is already taken. Choose another one."
msgstr "To ID jest już zajęte. Wybierz inne."

msgid "CSV or XML file"
msgstr "Plik CSV lub XML"

msgid "CSV, XML or text files only."
msgstr "Tylko pliki CSV, XML lub tekstowe."

#, python-format
msgid "That file stores weights in %(unit)s, which can't be imported."
msgstr "Ten plik zapisuje wagę w jednostce %(unit)s, której nie można zaimportować."

msgid "That file isn't a valid Hacker's Diet XML export."
msgstr "Ten plik nie jest prawidłowym eksportem XML z Hacker's Diet."

#, python-format
msgid "%(date)s: invalid date"
msgstr "%(date)s: nieprawidłowa data"

#, python-format
msgid "%(date)s: invalid weight %(value)s"
msgstr "%(date)s: nieprawidłowa waga %(value)s"

#, python-format
msgid "%(date)s: weight out of range"
msgstr "%(date)s: waga poza zakresem"

#. NOTE: Rate of weight change. %(grams)s is a signed whole number; g is gram.
#, python-format
msgid "%(grams)s g/day"
msgstr "%(grams)s g/dzień"

#. NOTE: Shown when too many sign-in codes were requested. %(num)d is a number
#. of minutes.
#, python-format
msgid "Too many requests. Try again in %(num)d minute."
msgid_plural "Too many requests. Try again in %(num)d minutes."
msgstr[0] "Zbyt wiele próśb o kod. Spróbuj ponownie za %(num)d minutę."
msgstr[1] "Zbyt wiele próśb o kod. Spróbuj ponownie za %(num)d minuty."
msgstr[2] "Zbyt wiele próśb o kod. Spróbuj ponownie za %(num)d minut."

#. NOTE: Chart range button: the whole recorded history.
msgid "All"
msgstr "Wszystko"

#. NOTE: Chart range button: 20 years. The letter is the unit, Y for year.
msgid "20Y"
msgstr "20R"

#. NOTE: Chart range button: 15 years. The letter is the unit, Y for year.
msgid "15Y"
msgstr "15R"

#. NOTE: Chart range button: 10 years. The letter is the unit, Y for year.
msgid "10Y"
msgstr "10R"

#. NOTE: Chart range button: 5 years. The letter is the unit, Y for year.
msgid "5Y"
msgstr "5R"

#. NOTE: Chart range button: 1 year. The letter is the unit, Y for year.
msgid "1Y"
msgstr "1R"

#. NOTE: Chart range button: 6 months. The letter is the unit, M for month.
msgid "6M"
msgstr "6M"

#. NOTE: Chart range button: 3 months. The letter is the unit, M for month.
msgid "3M"
msgstr "3M"

#. NOTE: Chart range button: 1 month. The letter is the unit, M for month.
msgid "1M"
msgstr "1M"

#. NOTE: Chart range button: 2 weeks. The letter is the unit, W for week.
msgid "2W"
msgstr "2T"

#. NOTE: Chart range button: 1 week. The letter is the unit, W for week.
msgid "1W"
msgstr "1T"

#. NOTE: Screen-reader name of a chart range button such as 5Y.
#, python-format
msgid "%(num)d year"
msgid_plural "%(num)d years"
msgstr[0] "%(num)d rok"
msgstr[1] "%(num)d lata"
msgstr[2] "%(num)d lat"

#. NOTE: Screen-reader name of a chart range button such as 3M.
#, python-format
msgid "%(num)d month"
msgid_plural "%(num)d months"
msgstr[0] "%(num)d miesiąc"
msgstr[1] "%(num)d miesiące"
msgstr[2] "%(num)d miesięcy"

#. NOTE: Screen-reader name of a chart range button such as 2W.
#, python-format
msgid "%(num)d week"
msgid_plural "%(num)d weeks"
msgstr[0] "%(num)d tydzień"
msgstr[1] "%(num)d tygodnie"
msgstr[2] "%(num)d tygodni"

#, python-format
msgid "%(num)d-day change"
msgid_plural "%(num)d-day change"
msgstr[0] "Zmiana (%(num)d dzień)"
msgstr[1] "Zmiana (%(num)d dni)"
msgstr[2] "Zmiana (%(num)d dni)"

msgid "Invalid date."
msgstr "Nieprawidłowa data."

msgid "Invalid request."
msgstr "Nieprawidłowe żądanie."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(weight)s is %(percent)s%% different from your entry of %(other)s on "
"%(date)s."
msgstr "%(weight)s różni się o %(percent)s%% od wpisu %(other)s z %(date)s."

msgid "Enter a valid weight, like 72.5."
msgstr "Wpisz prawidłową wagę, np. 72,5."

#, python-format
msgid "Weight must be between %(min)s and %(max)s kg."
msgstr "Waga musi mieścić się w zakresie od %(min)s do %(max)s kg."

msgid "Invalid range."
msgstr "Nieprawidłowy zakres."

msgid "Settings updated."
msgstr "Zapisano ustawienia."

msgid "Your chart is now public."
msgstr "Twój wykres jest teraz publiczny."

msgid "Your chart is no longer public."
msgstr "Twój wykres nie jest już publiczny."

#, python-format
msgid "Imported %(num)d entry."
msgid_plural "Imported %(num)d entries."
msgstr[0] "Zaimportowano %(num)d wpis."
msgstr[1] "Zaimportowano %(num)d wpisy."
msgstr[2] "Zaimportowano %(num)d wpisów."

#, python-format
msgid "Your height was set to %(height)s."
msgstr "Ustawiono wzrost: %(height)s."

#, python-format
msgid "%(num)d note without a weight was skipped."
msgid_plural "%(num)d notes without a weight were skipped."
msgstr[0] "Pominięto %(num)d notatkę bez wagi."
msgstr[1] "Pominięto %(num)d notatki bez wagi."
msgstr[2] "Pominięto %(num)d notatek bez wagi."

#, python-format
msgid "%(details)s (+%(count)d more)"
msgstr "%(details)s (i %(count)d więcej)"

#, python-format
msgid "Skipped %(num)d invalid line: %(details)s"
msgid_plural "Skipped %(num)d invalid lines: %(details)s"
msgstr[0] "Pominięto %(num)d nieprawidłowy wiersz: %(details)s"
msgstr[1] "Pominięto %(num)d nieprawidłowe wiersze: %(details)s"
msgstr[2] "Pominięto %(num)d nieprawidłowych wierszy: %(details)s"

msgid "No rows found in the file."
msgstr "Nie znaleziono wierszy w pliku."

msgid "Back"
msgstr "Wstecz"

msgid "About"
msgstr "O aplikacji"

msgid "Back to the dashboard"
msgstr "Wróć do strony głównej"

msgid "About Kilo Tracker"
msgstr "O Kilo Tracker"

#. The About page described in a search result (about 150 characters).
msgid ""
"Why Kilo Tracker was made, a video tutorial, and how signing in works "
"without a password or a stored email address."
msgstr ""
"Dlaczego powstał Kilo Tracker, samouczek wideo i jak działa logowanie bez "
"hasła i bez zapisanego adresu e-mail."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"For many years I tracked my weight with %(hdo_link)s, created by "
"%(walker_link)s. It kept working for a good while after his death, but in "
"March 2026 it finally stopped."
msgstr ""
"Przez wiele lat do śledzenia wagi służył mi %(hdo_link)s, którego autorem "
"był %(walker_link)s. Działał jeszcze długo po jego śmierci, ale w marcu 2026"
" roku przestał."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"I tried %(yadt_link)s as a replacement, but its interface wasn't for me. So "
"I vibe-coded my own version, and Kilo Tracker is the result. It's free for "
"anyone to use."
msgstr ""
"Zamiennikiem miał być %(yadt_link)s, ale jego interfejs mi nie odpowiadał. "
"Dlatego z pomocą AI (vibe coding) powstała moja własna wersja – Kilo "
"Tracker. Każdy może z niego korzystać za darmo."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Kilo Tracker is open source software. You can download the source code and "
"run your own copy from %(github_link)s."
msgstr ""
"Kilo Tracker to oprogramowanie open source. Możesz pobrać kod źródłowy i "
"uruchomić własną kopię z %(github_link)s."

#, python-format
msgid "I hope you like it! You can reach me at %(mail_link)s."
msgstr ""
"Mam nadzieję, że ci się spodoba! Możesz się ze mną skontaktować pod adresem "
"%(mail_link)s."

#. Version of the app, with the date of its last change. %(version)s is a link
#. such as v1.2 or a commit id.
#, python-format
msgid "Version %(version)s &middot; committed %(date)s"
msgstr "Wersja %(version)s &middot; commit z %(date)s"

#, python-format
msgid "Version %(version)s"
msgstr "Wersja %(version)s"

msgid "Video tutorial"
msgstr "Samouczek wideo"

msgid ""
"A 13-minute video on YouTube shows how Kilo Tracker works, from signing in "
"to sharing your chart and taking your data with you."
msgstr ""
"13-minutowy film na YouTube pokazuje, jak działa Kilo Tracker: od logowania,"
" przez udostępnianie wykresu, po eksport danych."

msgid "Watch the Kilo Tracker video tutorial on YouTube"
msgstr "Obejrzyj samouczek wideo Kilo Tracker na YouTube"

msgid "How signing in works"
msgstr "Jak działa logowanie"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"There are no passwords. Enter your email and we send a 6-digit code that's "
"valid for %(num)s minute — enter it and you're signed in."
msgid_plural ""
"There are no passwords. Enter your email and we send a 6-digit code that's "
"valid for %(num)s minutes — enter it and you're signed in."
msgstr[0] ""
"Nie ma haseł. Wpisz swój adres e-mail, a wyślemy ci 6-cyfrowy kod ważny "
"przez %(num)s minutę – wpisz go i gotowe."
msgstr[1] ""
"Nie ma haseł. Wpisz swój adres e-mail, a wyślemy ci 6-cyfrowy kod ważny "
"przez %(num)s minuty – wpisz go i gotowe."
msgstr[2] ""
"Nie ma haseł. Wpisz swój adres e-mail, a wyślemy ci 6-cyfrowy kod ważny "
"przez %(num)s minut – wpisz go i gotowe."

msgid "Gravatar uses"
msgstr "Gravatar"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"We never store your email address itself in our database. Instead we keep a "
"one-way SHA-256 hash of it (the same scheme %(gravatar_hash_link)s)."
msgstr ""
"Nigdy nie przechowujemy samego adresu e-mail w naszej bazie danych. Zamiast "
"tego zapisujemy jego jednokierunkowy skrót SHA-256 (ten sam schemat, którego"
" używa %(gravatar_hash_link)s)."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"That hash also doubles as your Gravatar id — if you have an avatar set up at"
" %(gravatar_link)s, it shows up automatically once you're signed in."
msgstr ""
"Ten skrót służy też jako twój identyfikator w Gravatarze – jeśli masz awatar"
" na %(gravatar_link)s, pojawi się automatycznie po zalogowaniu."

msgid ""
"Kilo fetches that avatar from Gravatar itself and keeps a copy for a day, so"
" Gravatar never sees your visits, your browser or your IP address."
msgstr ""
"Kilo samo pobiera ten awatar z Gravatara i przechowuje jego kopię przez "
"dzień, więc Gravatar nigdy nie widzi twoich wizyt, przeglądarki ani adresu "
"IP."

#. Label of the menu that picks the language of the website.
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Język"

#. First choice in the language menu: follow the language set in the web
#. browser.
msgid "Browser language"
msgstr "Język przeglądarki"

msgid "OK"
msgstr "OK"

#. Link for keyboard users at the very top of every page; it jumps past the
#. header.
msgid "Skip to main content"
msgstr "Przejdź do treści głównej"

msgid "Signed in"
msgstr "Zalogowano"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Ustawienia"

msgid "Log out"
msgstr "Wyloguj się"

#. Heading of the page shown when the server had an unexpected error.
msgid "Something went wrong"
msgstr "Coś poszło nie tak"

msgid "If you were saving something, check whether it was saved and try again."
msgstr ""
"Jeśli coś było w trakcie zapisywania, sprawdź, czy się zapisało, i spróbuj "
"ponownie."

msgid "Back to the start page"
msgstr "Wróć do strony głównej"

#. Title of the public page that shows someone's weight chart.
msgid "Weight chart"
msgstr "Wykres wagi"

#. Link for keyboard users at the top of the dashboard; it jumps past the chart
#. and the numbers to the list of days.
msgid "Skip to the daily log"
msgstr "Przejdź do dziennika"

#. Screen-reader label of the weight field of one day in the daily log;
#. %(date)s is a date such as 24 Oct 2026.
#, python-format
msgid "Weight on %(date)s"
msgstr "Waga z dnia %(date)s"

#. Screen-reader label of the note button of one day in the daily log; %(date)s
#. is a date such as 24 Oct 2026.
#, python-format
msgid "Note for %(date)s"
msgstr "Notatka z dnia %(date)s"

msgid "No note"
msgstr "Brak notatki"

msgid "Add a note…"
msgstr "Dodaj notatkę…"

#. Tooltip and screen-reader label of the button that opens a panel of emoji to
#. put in a note.
msgid "Insert an emoji"
msgstr "Wstaw emoji"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Anuluj"

#. Button that saves a note (verb).
#. Button that saves the settings (verb).
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Zapisz"

#. Label above the latest moving-average weight.
msgid "Current average"
msgstr "Obecna średnia"

msgid "No entries yet."
msgstr "Brak wpisów."

msgid "No entries yet — add your weight below."
msgstr "Brak wpisów – dodaj swoją wagę poniżej."

#. BMI is Body Mass Index; keep the abbreviation people know in your language.
msgid "BMI"
msgstr "BMI"

#. Third line of the BMI box: the body height in metres, for example "Height:
#. 1.86 m". %(height)s already includes the unit.
#, python-format
msgid "Height: %(height)s"
msgstr "Wzrost: %(height)s"

msgid "Set your height"
msgstr "Ustaw swój wzrost"

#, python-format
msgid "Show the %(range)s chart"
msgstr "Pokaż wykres %(range)s"

msgid "Show the whole history in the chart"
msgstr "Pokaż całą historię na wykresie"

#. Heading of the box about the logged weigh-ins: first date, last date and how
#. many.
msgid "Entries"
msgstr "Wpisy"

#. The date of the first entry.
msgid "First"
msgstr "Pierwszy"

#. The date of the last (most recent) entry.
msgid "Last"
msgstr "Ostatni"

#. The total number of entries.
msgid "Total"
msgstr "Razem"

msgid "Daily log"
msgstr "Dziennik"

msgid "Scroll to the most recent entry"
msgstr "Przewiń do najnowszego wpisu"

msgid "Most recent entry"
msgstr "Najnowszy wpis"

#. Column headers of the daily log: the day, the weight in kilograms, and a
#. free-text note.
msgid "Date"
msgstr "Data"

msgid "Weight (kg)"
msgstr "Waga (kg)"

msgid "Note"
msgstr "Notatka"

#. Heading above the emoji the user picked most recently.
msgid "Recently used"
msgstr "Ostatnio używane"

msgid "Loading more days…"
msgstr "Wczytywanie kolejnych dni…"

msgid "Log today's weight?"
msgstr "Zapisać dzisiejszą wagę?"

msgid "You haven't recorded a weight for today yet."
msgstr "Nie zapisano jeszcze wagi na dziś."

msgid "e.g. 82.4"
msgstr "np. 82,4"

msgid "Skip"
msgstr "Pomiń"

msgid "Unusual value"
msgstr "Nietypowa wartość"

msgid "Correct it"
msgstr "Popraw"

msgid "Save anyway"
msgstr "Zapisz mimo to"

#. Button that brings back a weight that was just deleted from the daily log.
msgid "Undo"
msgstr "Cofnij"

#. Title of a dialog: the login session has timed out; the page must be
#. reloaded.
msgid "Session expired"
msgstr "Sesja wygasła"

#. Button that reloads the web page.
msgid "Reload page"
msgstr "Odśwież stronę"

#. Name of the whole period (the "All" range button) in the chart's description
#. for screen readers.
msgid "All weigh-ins"
msgstr "Wszystkie pomiary"

#. The chart in words, for screen readers. %(period)s is a period such as "3
#. months"; the weights are such as "82.4 kg".
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(period)s: from %(first)s on %(first_date)s to %(last)s on %(last_date)s. "
"Lowest %(lowest)s, highest %(highest)s, average %(average)s."
msgstr ""
"%(period)s: od %(first)s (%(first_date)s) do %(last)s (%(last_date)s). "
"Najniższa %(lowest)s, najwyższa %(highest)s, średnia %(average)s."

#. The chart in words, for screen readers, when the period shown has no
#. weights.
#, python-format
msgid "%(period)s: no weigh-ins in this period."
msgstr "%(period)s: brak pomiarów w tym okresie."

#. The chart in words when the owner hides the weights on the public page: only
#. the line's direction.
#, python-format
msgid "%(period)s: the line ends lower than it starts."
msgstr "%(period)s: linia kończy się niżej, niż się zaczyna."

#. The chart in words when the owner hides the weights on the public page: only
#. the line's direction.
#, python-format
msgid "%(period)s: the line ends higher than it starts."
msgstr "%(period)s: linia kończy się wyżej, niż się zaczyna."

#. The chart in words when the owner hides the weights on the public page: only
#. the line's direction.
#, python-format
msgid "%(period)s: the line ends at the same height as it starts."
msgstr "%(period)s: linia kończy się na tej samej wysokości, na której się zaczyna."

#, python-format
msgid "%(num)d-day average"
msgid_plural "%(num)d-day average"
msgstr[0] "Średnia (%(num)d dzień)"
msgstr[1] "Średnia (%(num)d dni)"
msgstr[2] "Średnia (%(num)d dni)"

msgid "Overall average"
msgstr "Średnia ogólna"

#, python-format
msgid "BMI (%(num)d-day avg): %(bmi)s"
msgid_plural "BMI (%(num)d-day avg): %(bmi)s"
msgstr[0] "BMI (średnia: %(num)d dzień): %(bmi)s"
msgstr[1] "BMI (średnia: %(num)d dni): %(bmi)s"
msgstr[2] "BMI (średnia: %(num)d dni): %(bmi)s"

msgid "Saving…"
msgstr "Zapisywanie…"

msgid "Saved"
msgstr "Zapisano"

msgid "Could not save"
msgstr "Nie udało się zapisać"

msgid "Could not save."
msgstr "Nie udało się zapisać."

msgid "Error saving"
msgstr "Błąd zapisu"

#, python-format
msgid "Weight of %(date)s removed."
msgstr "Usunięto pomiar z %(date)s."

msgid "Sign in"
msgstr "Zaloguj się"

msgid "Enter your email and we'll send you a 6-digit code — no password needed."
msgstr "Wpisz swój adres e-mail, a wyślemy ci 6-cyfrowy kod – bez hasła."

msgid "Send code"
msgstr "Wyślij kod"

#. Title of the front page as shown in a search result, after "Kilo Tracker —".
msgid "Free weight tracker with a moving average"
msgstr "Darmowy dziennik wagi ze średnią kroczącą"

#. Kilo Tracker described in a search result (about 150 characters).
msgid ""
"A free, open-source weight tracker that shows your trend, not the daily ups "
"and downs. No passwords, no ads, no trackers."
msgstr ""
"Darmowy dziennik wagi o otwartym kodzie, który pokazuje trend, a nie "
"codzienne wahania. Bez haseł, reklam i śledzenia."

msgid "A weight tracker that shows the trend"
msgstr "Dziennik wagi, który pokazuje trend"

msgid ""
"Your weight goes up and down from day to day. Kilo Tracker draws a moving "
"average through your weigh-ins, so you see where you are really heading. "
"It's free and open source."
msgstr ""
"Waga zmienia się z dnia na dzień. Kilo Tracker wylicza średnią kroczącą z "
"twoich pomiarów, dzięki czemu widzisz, dokąd naprawdę zmierzasz. Jest "
"darmowy i ma otwarty kod."

msgid "A clear chart, from one week to twenty years, coloured by your BMI."
msgstr ""
"Przejrzysty wykres, od tygodnia do dwudziestu lat, w kolorach zależnych od "
"BMI."

msgid "Quick entry: type today's weight and add a note if you like."
msgstr "Szybkie wpisywanie: wpisz dzisiejszą wagę i, jeśli chcesz, dodaj notatkę."

#. "The Hacker's Diet Online" and "Yet Another Diet Tool" are names of other
#. weight trackers; keep them as they are.
msgid ""
"Bring your history from The Hacker's Diet Online, Yet Another Diet Tool or a"
" CSV file, and download all your data whenever you like."
msgstr ""
"Przenieś swoją historię z The Hacker's Diet Online, Yet Another Diet Tool "
"lub pliku CSV i pobieraj wszystkie swoje dane, kiedy tylko chcesz."

msgid ""
"Share your chart with a link or put it on your own website, with or without "
"the kilograms."
msgstr ""
"Udostępnij swój wykres linkiem lub umieść go na własnej stronie, z "
"kilogramami lub bez."

msgid "Private by design"
msgstr "Prywatność od podstaw"

msgid ""
"There are no passwords: you sign in with a code sent to your email. Kilo "
"stores only a one-way hash of your address, and has no ads or trackers."
msgstr ""
"Nie ma haseł: logujesz się kodem wysłanym na twój e-mail. Kilo przechowuje "
"tylko jednokierunkowy skrót twojego adresu i nie ma reklam ani śledzenia."

#. Shown at a public chart's address when there is no chart there, or its owner
#. stopped sharing it.
msgid "There is no public chart at this address (any more)."
msgstr "Pod tym adresem nie ma (już) publicznego wykresu."

msgid "Remove my data"
msgstr "Usuń moje dane"

msgid "Back to settings"
msgstr "Wróć do ustawień"

msgid ""
"This permanently deletes your account, all your weigh-ins and notes, and "
"your settings. It can't be undone."
msgstr ""
"Spowoduje to trwałe usunięcie twojego konta, wszystkich pomiarów i notatek "
"oraz ustawień. Tej operacji nie można cofnąć."

msgid "Step 1: Download your data"
msgstr "Krok 1: Pobierz swoje dane"

msgid "download it again"
msgstr "pobrać je ponownie"

#, python-format
msgid "Downloaded. You can %(again_link)s."
msgstr "Pobrano. Możesz %(again_link)s."

msgid "Download a copy of your weigh-ins before they're deleted. This is required."
msgstr ""
"Pobierz kopię swoich pomiarów, zanim zostaną usunięte. Ten krok jest "
"obowiązkowy."

msgid "Download my data (CSV)"
msgstr "Pobierz moje dane (CSV)"

msgid "I've downloaded it — continue"
msgstr "Pobrano – kontynuuj"

msgid "Step 2: Confirm by email"
msgstr "Krok 2: Potwierdź e-mailem"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"We sent a 6-digit code to <strong>%(email)s</strong>. It expires in %(num)s "
"minute."
msgid_plural ""
"We sent a 6-digit code to <strong>%(email)s</strong>. It expires in %(num)s "
"minutes."
msgstr[0] ""
"Wysłaliśmy 6-cyfrowy kod na adres <strong>%(email)s</strong>. Wygasa za "
"%(num)s minutę."
msgstr[1] ""
"Wysłaliśmy 6-cyfrowy kod na adres <strong>%(email)s</strong>. Wygasa za "
"%(num)s minuty."
msgstr[2] ""
"Wysłaliśmy 6-cyfrowy kod na adres <strong>%(email)s</strong>. Wygasa za "
"%(num)s minut."

msgid "Delete everything"
msgstr "Usuń wszystko"

msgid "Resend code"
msgstr "Wyślij kod ponownie"

#, python-format
msgid "We'll email a confirmation code to <strong>%(email)s</strong>."
msgstr "Wyślemy kod potwierdzający na adres <strong>%(email)s</strong>."

msgid "Send confirmation code"
msgstr "Wyślij kod potwierdzający"

msgid "Your height is used to calculate your BMI."
msgstr "Wzrost służy do obliczania BMI."

#. Heading of the settings section about showing the weight chart on a public
#. web page.
msgid "Public chart"
msgstr "Publiczny wykres"

msgid ""
"Show your chart and stat boxes on a public page that anyone with the link "
"can see, and that you can embed in another website. Your notes, your email "
"address and your daily log are never shown."
msgstr ""
"Pokaż swój wykres i pola statystyk na publicznej stronie, którą może "
"zobaczyć każdy, kto ma link, i którą możesz osadzić w innej witrynie. Twoje "
"notatki, adres e-mail i dziennik nigdy nie są pokazywane."

msgid ""
"Switched off, the chart shows only the shape of the line: no kilograms, no "
"BMI and no stat boxes."
msgstr ""
"Po wyłączeniu wykres pokazuje tylko kształt linii: bez kilogramów, bez BMI i"
" bez pól statystyk."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The last part of the page's address: %(min)d to %(max)d letters (a-z), "
"digits, hyphens or underscores. Leave it empty for a new random ID."
msgstr ""
"Ostatnia część adresu strony: od %(min)d do %(max)d liter (a-z), cyfr, "
"łączników lub podkreśleń. Zostaw puste, aby wygenerować nowe losowe ID."

#. Label of a menu in the settings: which period the shared chart shows.
msgid "Chart range"
msgstr "Zakres wykresu"

#. First choice of the chart range menu: the chart keeps its range buttons and
#. the visitor picks.
msgid "Visitor chooses (range buttons)"
msgstr "Wybiera odwiedzający (przyciski zakresu)"

msgid "Your public chart:"
msgstr "Twój publiczny wykres:"

msgid "To show it in another website, put this code in that page's HTML:"
msgstr "Aby osadzić go na innej stronie, wstaw ten kod do jej kodu HTML:"

msgid "Import data"
msgstr "Importuj dane"

#. The text in <code> only names the three columns of a line such as
#. 23-9-26,79.7,text. Translate the names (date, weight, note): the file itself
#. has no header and is the same in every language.
msgid ""
"Import weigh-ins from a CSV text file. Each line is "
"<code>date,weight,note</code> (note is optional), for example:"
msgstr ""
"Zaimportuj pomiary z pliku tekstowego CSV. Każdy wiersz ma postać "
"<code>data,waga,notatka</code> (notatka jest opcjonalna), na przykład:"

#. Example notes in the CSV sample. The CSV format itself (dates, dot as
#. decimal separator) stays the same in every language.
msgid "optional notes"
msgstr "opcjonalne notatki"

msgid "some text"
msgstr "jakiś tekst"

#. d-M-yy and d-M-yyyy describe the date pattern, as in 23-9-26 or 23-9-2026.
#. Use the first letter of the word for day, month (keep a capital M, so it
#. cannot be mistaken for minutes) and year in your language, e.g. j-M-aa in
#. French. The numbers in the file are always day-month-year.
msgid ""
"Dates are <code>d-M-yy</code> or <code>d-M-yyyy</code>; weight is in "
"kilograms. Importing a date that already has an entry overwrites it."
msgstr ""
"Daty mają postać <code>d-M-rr</code> lub <code>d-M-rrrr</code>; waga jest w "
"kilogramach. Zaimportowanie daty, która ma już wpis, nadpisuje go."

#. "The Hacker's Diet Online" and "Yet Another Diet Tool" are names of web
#. services; do not translate them.
msgid ""
"You can also import the CSV or XML export of The Hacker's Diet Online, or "
"the CSV export of Yet Another Diet Tool. Weights, notes and, from the XML "
"file, your height are imported; everything else is ignored."
msgstr ""
"Możesz też zaimportować eksport CSV lub XML z The Hacker's Diet Online albo "
"eksport CSV z Yet Another Diet Tool. Importowane są wagi, notatki oraz, z "
"pliku XML, wzrost; wszystko inne jest ignorowane."

msgid "Import"
msgstr "Importuj"

msgid "Export data"
msgstr "Eksportuj dane"

msgid "Download all your weigh-ins as a CSV file (date, weight in kilograms, note)."
msgstr ""
"Pobierz wszystkie swoje pomiary jako plik CSV (data, waga w kilogramach, "
"notatka)."

msgid "Export CSV"
msgstr "Eksportuj CSV"

#. Heading of the settings section that ends the sign-in on every other browser
#. and device.
msgid "Sign out everywhere"
msgstr "Wyloguj wszędzie"

msgid ""
"Signed in on a computer that isn't yours, or lost a phone? This signs you "
"out on every other browser and device. You stay signed in here."
msgstr ""
"Logowanie na cudzym komputerze albo zgubiony telefon? Ten przycisk wyloguje "
"cię ze wszystkich innych przeglądarek i urządzeń. Na tym urządzeniu sesja "
"pozostanie aktywna."

#. Button that ends the sign-in on all other browsers and devices (not on this
#. one).
msgid "Sign out on other devices"
msgstr "Wyloguj na innych urządzeniach"

msgid ""
"Permanently delete your account and all your weigh-ins. You'll be asked to "
"download your data and confirm with a code sent by email first."
msgstr ""
"Trwale usuń swoje konto i wszystkie pomiary. Najpierw trzeba będzie pobrać "
"dane i potwierdzić operację kodem wysłanym e-mailem."

msgid "Remove my data…"
msgstr "Usuń moje dane…"

msgid "Sign up"
msgstr "Zarejestruj się"

msgid "Enter your email and we'll send you a 6-digit verification code."
msgstr "Wpisz swój adres e-mail, a wyślemy ci 6-cyfrowy kod weryfikacyjny."

msgid "Verify your email"
msgstr "Zweryfikuj swój adres e-mail"

msgid "Enter your code"
msgstr "Wpisz swój kod"

msgid "Verify"
msgstr "Zweryfikuj"

#. NOTE: Label of the optional goal weight field in the settings.
msgid "Goal weight (kg)"
msgstr "Waga docelowa (kg)"

#. NOTE: Error under the goal weight field in the settings.
msgid "Enter the goal as a plain number, e.g. 75 or 72.5."
msgstr "Wpisz cel jako zwykłą liczbę, np. 75 lub 72,5."

#. NOTE: Settings label: the days over which the goal date's pace is measured.
msgid "Goal date trend (days)"
msgstr "Okres trendu dla daty celu (dni)"

#. NOTE: Switch in the settings: show the goal weight on the public chart.
msgid "Show my goal"
msgstr "Pokaż mój cel"

#. E.g. "Goal 75.0 kg: 4.3 kg to go"; both values include the unit.
#, python-format
msgid "Goal %(goal)s: %(distance)s to go"
msgstr "Cel %(goal)s: zostało %(distance)s"

#. The moving average has reached the goal, e.g. "Goal 75.0 kg reached".
#, python-format
msgid "Goal %(goal)s reached"
msgstr "Cel %(goal)s osiągnięty"

#. Instead of a goal date: the trend does not head for the goal. Neutral.
msgid "No date at this pace"
msgstr "Brak daty przy tym tempie"

#. Instead of a goal date: too few days of data for the trend yet.
msgid "Not enough data for a date yet"
msgstr "Za mało danych, by wyznaczyć datę"

#. Name of the goal weight line in the chart's tooltip.
msgid "Goal"
msgstr "Cel"

#. Explanation above the goal weight fields in the settings.
msgid ""
"A goal weight is optional: it shows as a line on the chart and, under the "
"current average, how far it is and roughly when you reach it at your current"
" pace. That pace is the change of your moving average over the goal date "
"trend."
msgstr ""
"Waga docelowa jest opcjonalna: pojawia się jako linia na wykresie, a pod "
"obecną średnią widać, ile jeszcze zostało i mniej więcej kiedy przy obecnym "
"tempie zostanie osiągnięta. Tempo liczone jest jako zmiana średniej "
"kroczącej w okresie trendu dla daty celu."

#. Goal line tooltip, e.g. "Goal can be reached around 12 March 2027".
#, python-format
msgid "Goal can be reached around %(date)s"
msgstr "Cel można osiągnąć około %(date)s"
